# Pox Plague: "Each player loses half their life, then discards half the cards in their hand, then sacrifices half the permanents they control. Round down each time." Life 20 each goes to 10; Bot1 holds 2 cards (discards 1) and controls 5 Moxen (sacrifices 2); Bot2 holds 5 (discards 2) and controls 3 (sacrifices 1). Each player chooses their own.

